#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Standalone circuit-drawing function {#standalone-circuit-drawing-function}"
msgstr ""
"Fungsi lukisan litar bersendirian {#standalone-circuit-drawing-function}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have an application where you prefer to draw a circuit with a self-"
"contained function instead of as a method of a circuit object, you can "
"directly use the `circuit_drawer()` function, which is part of the public "
"stable interface from `qiskit.visualization`. The function behaves "
"identically to the `circuit.draw()` method, except that it takes in a "
"circuit object as a required argument.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika anda mempunyai aplikasi di mana anda lebih suka melukis litar dengan "
"fungsi bebas berbanding sebagai kaedah objek litar, anda boleh menggunakan "
"fungsi `circuit_drawer()` secara langsung, yang merupakan sebahagian "
"daripada antara muka awam stabil dari `qiskit.visualization`. Fungsi ini "
"berkelakuan sama seperti kaedah `circuit.draw()`, kecuali ia mengambil objek"
" litar sebagai argumen yang diperlukan.\n"

